---
// ResearchHighlight.astro — Dedicated IEEE YESIST12 Medical AI Research Showcase
---

<section id="research" class="py-20 md:py-24 bg-[#223971]/[0.03] border-y border-[#223971]/10">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#223971] font-semibold block mb-3">Publikasi & Riset</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#111827]">Deteksi Tuberkulosis Berbasis Deep Learning</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Description & Achievements -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-[#4B5563] leading-relaxed">
          Penelitian ini berfokus pada deteksi dini Tuberkulosis dari citra X-ray dada (*Chest X-Ray* TBX11K) yang memerlukan model AI dengan akurasi dan interpretabilitas tinggi untuk konteks klinis. Mengevaluasi performa ekstraksi fitur lokal <strong class="text-[#111827]">Hybrid CNN</strong> (DenseNet–EfficientNetV2-B3) versus mekanisme atensi global <strong class="text-[#111827]">Vision Transformers</strong> (Swin & DeiT).
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E5E7EB] p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#111827] text-base mb-4">Capaian & Metrik Utama</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#223971] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
              <span class="text-[#4B5563]"><strong class="text-[#111827]">97.0%</strong> Accuracy & F1-Score pada dataset klinis</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#223971] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
              <span class="text-[#4B5563]"><strong class="text-[#111827]">100%</strong> Recall untuk kelas Healthy (eliminasi false positives)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#B38C00] mr-3 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
              <span class="text-[#4B5563]">Dipresentasikan dan dipublikasikan pada <strong class="text-[#111827]">IEEE YESIST12</strong></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-[#111827] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Teknologi & Pendekatan</h4>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {["PyTorch", "DenseNet", "EfficientNetV2-B3", "Swin Transformer", "DeiT", "Grad-CAM"].map(tech => (
              <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-[#FFC906]/15 text-[#996F00] px-3 py-1 rounded border border-[#FFC906]/30 font-medium">
                {tech}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Comparison Table & Grad-CAM -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-[#E5E7EB] overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <div class="px-6 py-3.5 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/80">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#111827] text-sm">Perbandingan Model Penelitian</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
              <thead>
                <tr class="text-[#4B5563] border-b border-gray-200">
                  <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-xs uppercase">Arsitektur Model</th>
                  <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-xs uppercase text-center">Accuracy</th>
                  <th class="pb-3 font-semibold text-xs uppercase text-center">F1-Score</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
                <tr class="bg-[#223971]/[0.04]">
                  <td class="py-3.5 text-[#111827] font-semibold">Hybrid CNN (DenseNet–EfficientNetV2-B3)</td>
                  <td class="py-3.5 text-[#223971] font-bold font-mono text-center">97.0%</td>
                  <td class="py-3.5 text-[#223971] font-bold font-mono text-center">97.0%</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 text-[#4B5563]">Swin Transformer</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-gray-400 italic text-xs text-center" colspan="2">Benchmark comparison</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 text-[#4B5563]">DeiT (Vision Transformers)</td>
                  <td class="py-3 text-gray-400 italic text-xs text-center" colspan="2">Benchmark comparison</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Grad-CAM Attention Map Card -->
        <div class="bg-[#111827] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-md">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-[#111827] via-[#162032] to-[#1e2d42] flex items-center justify-center p-6 relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#223971]/30 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="text-center relative z-10 space-y-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 mx-auto rounded-full bg-[#FFC906]/10 border border-[#FFC906]/30 flex items-center justify-center text-[#FFC906]">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.75" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-300 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
                Visualisasi Grad-CAM: Peta atensi (*attention heat-map*) pada region paru-paru untuk interpretabilitas klinis deteksi patologi.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
